# The Supabase anon key is public by design (it ships in the browser bundle);
# access is enforced by Row Level Security.
# NEVER put a service-role key (or any other secret) in a VITE_ variable:
# everything prefixed VITE_ is embedded in the client bundle.
# Project URL (not secret): https://yafbphagorydbitfgfmg.supabase.co
# The anon key goes ONLY in the gitignored .env.local - never in this file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
